y, since they need an LLM re-pass via --update","source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_wiki_export","label":"--wiki agent-crawlable wiki","rationale":"Any agent can be pointed at index.md and navigate the knowledge base by reading files instead of parsing JSON","source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_neo4j_export","label":"Neo4j / GraphML / SVG export","rationale":null,"source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_mcp_server","label":"MCP stdio server","rationale":null,"source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_token_benchmark","label":"71.5x token reduction benchmark","rationale":"Savings compound because after the first extraction run every query reads the compact graph rather than raw files; reduction scales with corpus size, so small corpora gain structural clarity rather than compression","source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_privacy_model","label":"Privacy model (no telemetry, local code processing)","rationale":null,"source_file":"docs/translations/README.ja-JP.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_ja_jp_karpathy_raw_folder","label":"Karpathy /raw f